d v2.3, removed after v2.3</td></tr><tr><td>OM2<a name=\"OM2\"> </a></td><td>Observation text master file segments (e.g., Lab)</td><td>deprecated</td><td>added v2.2, removed after v2.3</td></tr><tr><td>OM3<a name=\"OM3\"> </a></td><td>Observation text master file segments (e.g., Lab)</td><td>deprecated</td><td>added v2.2, removed after v2.3</td></tr><tr><td>OM4<a name=\"OM4\"> </a></td><td>Observation text master file segments (e.g., Lab)</td><td>deprecated</td><td>added v2.2, removed after v2.3</td></tr><tr><td>OM5<a name=\"OM5\"> </a></td><td>Observation text master file segments (e.g., Lab)</td><td>deprecated</td><td>added v2.2, removed after v2.3</td></tr><tr><td>OM6<a name=\"OM6\"> </a></td><td>Observation text master file segments (e.g., Lab)</td><td>deprecated</td><td>added v2.2, removed after v2.3</td></tr><tr><td>OMA<a name=\"OMA\"> </a></td><td>Numerical observation master file</td><td/><td>added v2.3.1</td></tr><tr><td>OMB<a name=\"OMB\"> </a></td><td>Categorical observation master file</td><td/><td>added v2.3.1</td></tr><tr><td>OMC<a name=\"OMC\"> </a></td><td>Observation batteries master file</td><td/><td>added v2.3.1</td></tr><tr><td>OMD<a name=\"OMD\"> </a></td><td>Calculated observations master file</td><td/><td>added v2.3.1</td></tr><tr><td>OME<a name=\"OME\"> </a></td><td>Other Observation/Service Item master file</td><td/><td>added v2.4</td></tr><tr><td>OMM<a name=\"OMM\"> </a></td><td>Mixed type observation master file</td><td/><td>added v2.8.2</td></tr><tr><td>PRA<a name=\"PRA\"> </a></td><td>Practitioner master file</td><td/><td>added v2.2</td></tr><tr><td>STF<a name=\"STF\"> </a></td><td>Staff master file</td><td/><td>added v2.2</td></tr></table>\r\n</div>"
