          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p>Payee Type</p>\r\n<table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td><td><b>Version</b></td></tr><tr><td>EMPL<a name=\"EMPL\"> </a></td><td>Employer</td><td>A legal entity that controls and directs a worker under an express or implied contract of employment and a salary or wages in compensation.\r\n\r\nIn worker\342\200\231s compensation cases, the Employer may be the \342\200\234organization\342\200\235 responsible for paying the healthcare charges for employment related illness or injury.</td><td>added v2.6</td></tr><tr><td>ORG<a name=\"ORG\"> </a></td><td>Payee Organization</td><td>The payee is not a person/individual/being, but an entity commonly identified as an organization.  Examples could be a country healthcare payer, or an insurance company responsible for payment.</td><td>added v2.6</td></tr><tr><td>PERS<a name=\"PERS\"> </a></td><td>Person</td><td>A person/individual/being.</td><td>added v2.6</td></tr><tr><td>PPER<a name=\"PPER\"> </a></td><td>Pay Person</td><td>Person/individual/being responsible for payment.</td><td>added v2.6</td></tr></table>\r\n</div>"
