      concept {
        extension {
          url {
            value: "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/codesystem-concept-comments"
          }
          value {
            string_value {
              value: "Placer or Filler Applications.\r\nA request by the placer for the filler, or the filler to the placer,  to discontinue a previously requested service. The differentiation between discontinue and cancel is that discontinue effects the order/service and all future occurrences, cancel refers to just the present action. \r\nTypical responses include, but are not limited to, CR \342\200\223 Cancelled as requested, UC \342\200\223 Unable to Cancel."
              extension {
                url {
                  value: "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation"
