          value {
            string_value {
              value: "Note that the escape sequences used in this mode do not use the ASCII \342\200\234esc\342\200\235 character, as defined in ISO 2022-1994. They are \342\200\234HL7 escape sequences\342\200\235 as first defined in HL7 2.3, sec. 2.9.2. (Also, note that sections 2.8.28.6.1and 2.9.2 in HL7 2.3 correspond to sections 2.16.93 and 2.7.2 in HL7 2. 5.)"
