              value: "Enter (IM) when INFORMATION MANAGEMENT is the reason due to:\r\n\342\200\242 Database or Programming issues\r\n\342\200\242 Overriding of test results\r\n\342\200\242 Inaccurate calculations\r\n\342\200\242 Inaccurate flagging, reference ranges, units of measure\r\n\342\200\242 Incomplete/inaccurate transmission of test results\r\n\342\200\242 Other"
            }
